[105] Image: image
ESP32-S3-Wroom-1 board
ESP32 is housed in [106]quad-flat no-leads (QFN) packages
of varying sizes with 49 pads. Specifically, 48 connection
pads along the sides and one large thermal pad (connected
to ground) on the bottom.
